(7346603, 1148834, 119667, '<td valign="top">nicely composed, attractive model, not overly-processed, mirrors/windows in background slightly distracting. Would be interesting to know if eye contact portraits score better than those without...</td>', 'nicely composed, attractive model, not overly-processed, mirrors/windows in background slightly distracting. Would be interesting to know if eye contact portraits score better than those without...', '2015-05-01 05:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
