(7346693, 1147568, 119667, '<td valign="top">nice ''romantic'' picture. I wonder if the cherry blossoms in the front would have been better if more in focus? As it is they are so blurred as to make it seem as though your lens has pink water droplets on. Also, the line of the concrete wall goes straight through the man''s head. A little bit to the right or left (but not splitting the couple) might have been better</td>', 'nice ''romantic'' picture. I wonder if the cherry blossoms in the front would have been better if more in focus? As it is they are so blurred as to make it seem as though your lens has pink water droplets on. Also, the line of the concrete wall goes straight through the man''s head. A little bit to the right or left (but not splitting the couple) might have been better', '2015-05-01 09:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7346694, 1148612, 119667, '<td valign="top">nice colours. people in the background are distracting. you could have cropped them out.</td>', 'nice colours. people in the background are distracting. you could have cropped them out.', '2015-05-01 09:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
