(7347170, 1147791, 159723, '<td valign="top">I like the warm colours, but there is something that I can''t quite put my finger on. I think it might be that the colours in the alley are so dark and warm that I would expect the sky to be not quite so blue. Or maybe I''m wrong :)</td>', 'I like the warm colours, but there is something that I can''t quite put my finger on. I think it might be that the colours in the alley are so dark and warm that I would expect the sky to be not quite so blue. Or maybe I''m wrong :)', '2015-05-03 08:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7347171, 1147492, 159723, '<td valign="top">Really cool shot! The only thing is that I wish her face was a bit sharper and that her whole hand was in the picture.</td>', 'Really cool shot! The only thing is that I wish her face was a bit sharper and that her whole hand was in the picture.', '2015-05-03 08:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7347172, 1147007, 159723, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot! For me the rocks in the foreground takes the attention away from the bridge and the lovely sea. Would be interesting to see a more cropped version. Perhaps right between the two larger rocks in the foreground?</td>', 'Lovely shot! For me the rocks in the foreground takes the attention away from the bridge and the lovely sea. Would be interesting to see a more cropped version. Perhaps right between the two larger rocks in the foreground?', '2015-05-03 08:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7347173, 1149048, 159723, '<td valign="top">I wish her arms and body where frozen, but that''s about the only thing I "don''t like" about the image. Everything else is awesome!</td>', 'I wish her arms and body where frozen, but that''s about the only thing I "don''t like" about the image. Everything else is awesome!', '2015-05-03 08:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7347174, 1148781, 159723, '<td valign="top">What an amazing tree! For me the tone in the tree is too similar to that in the ground and with the ground being a little lighter it takes some attention away from the tree. Besides that, nice shot!</td>', 'What an amazing tree! For me the tone in the tree is too similar to that in the ground and with the ground being a little lighter it takes some attention away from the tree. Besides that, nice shot!', '2015-05-03 08:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7347175, 1148895, 159723, '<td valign="top">The black frame (I don''t know the technical word for it) is not doing it for me, but besides that I think it is a nice shot. Looks like a lovely day for a festival :)</td>', 'The black frame (I don''t know the technical word for it) is not doing it for me, but besides that I think it is a nice shot. Looks like a lovely day for a festival :)', '2015-05-03 08:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
