(7347523, 1148563, 159723, '<td valign="top">Great shot, but I''m not sure about the processing. I think it might be the saturation in the sky, that at least in my eyes, don''t match the mountains and ground.</td>', 'Great shot, but I''m not sure about the processing. I think it might be the saturation in the sky, that at least in my eyes, don''t match the mountains and ground.', '2015-05-04 07:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
