(7347526, 1148855, 159723, '<td valign="top">Hopefully, this does not come across as douchy, but I find that tranquility can be really hard to convey in a photo. As much as I want to feel it here, I think this might be one of those instances where you have to be there. Or maybe it is just me. Nevertheless, continue enjoying your hidden gem, because that''s what matters the most :)</td>', 'Hopefully, this does not come across as douchy, but I find that tranquility can be really hard to convey in a photo. As much as I want to feel it here, I think this might be one of those instances where you have to be there. Or maybe it is just me. Nevertheless, continue enjoying your hidden gem, because that''s what matters the most :)', '2015-05-04 07:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7347527, 1148919, 159723, '<td valign="top">Looks like a cool chick! I think a different aperture might have improved the image, so that both eyes were in focus</td>', 'Looks like a cool chick! I think a different aperture might have improved the image, so that both eyes were in focus', '2015-05-04 07:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
