(7348510, 1148766, 58634, '<td valign="top">I really like how you can see a tiny reflection of it on the water. Other than that, I feel like this could use a contrast bump to bring out more of the beautiful colors, especially in the sky. I think it would also improve the texture of the rocks.</td>', 'I really like how you can see a tiny reflection of it on the water. Other than that, I feel like this could use a contrast bump to bring out more of the beautiful colors, especially in the sky. I think it would also improve the texture of the rocks.', '2015-05-06 20:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7348511, 1148064, 113411, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful !!!</td>', 'This is wonderful !!!', '2015-05-06 20:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7348512, 1148211, 58634, '<td valign="top">I love the BRIGHT BLUE you''ve got going on here. The softness seems a bit excessive and unnecessary, but I do like this shot overall.</td>', 'I love the BRIGHT BLUE you''ve got going on here. The softness seems a bit excessive and unnecessary, but I do like this shot overall.', '2015-05-06 20:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7348513, 1149028, 58634, '<td valign="top">So simple, yet I love the way this looks.. From the intricate leaf patterns, to their beautiful green color, to the intricate twist in its stem, to the background trees and the orange sky. <br/> <br/>I just really like it!</td>', 'So simple, yet I love the way this looks.. From the intricate leaf patterns, to their beautiful green color, to the intricate twist in its stem, to the background trees and the orange sky.  I just really like it!', '2015-05-06 20:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7348514, 1148781, 58634, '<td valign="top">what a pretty tree.. I like how "white" this is.. It really gives the tree some characters and almost makes it look like there''s snow on the ground!</td>', 'what a pretty tree.. I like how "white" this is.. It really gives the tree some characters and almost makes it look like there''s snow on the ground!', '2015-05-06 20:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
