(7348844, 1147869, 147314, '<td valign="top">I don''t like baby shots and this image shows exactly why: The baby, she is gorgeous, those eyes, wow! The image is crisp and the use of a shallow depth of field is sublime. But why put on such a sad kind of lace cap (if that''s the correct description). To me it really takes away the beauty of this image.</td>', 'I don''t like baby shots and this image shows exactly why: The baby, she is gorgeous, those eyes, wow! The image is crisp and the use of a shallow depth of field is sublime. But why put on such a sad kind of lace cap (if that''s the correct description). To me it really takes away the beauty of this image.', '2015-05-07 16:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
