(7349087, 1148564, 121949, '<td valign="top"><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=114285" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Neat</a> I wish I could tell you what I used. NIK software, and a lot of curves and masking. But it really was a little of this and a little of that until it looked like what I wanted. Now I wish I would have written it down.</td>', ' Neat I wish I could tell you what I used. NIK software, and a lot of curves and masking. But it really was a little of this and a little of that until it looked like what I wanted. Now I wish I would have written it down.', '2015-05-08 01:16:55.000000', NULL, 0),
