(7349133, 1148564, 114285, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by sjhuls:</b></div><hr/><i> <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=114285" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Neat</a> I wish I could tell you what I used. NIK software, and a lot of curves and masking. But it really was a little of this and a little of that until it looked like what I wanted. Now I wish I would have written it down. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Ok no problems I do the same, always forget, I noticed her hair had a gorgeous golden hue!</td>', 'Originally posted by sjhuls:  Neat I wish I could tell you what I used. NIK software, and a lot of curves and masking. But it really was a little of this and a little of that until it looked like what I wanted. Now I wish I would have written it down.   Ok no problems I do the same, always forget, I noticed her hair had a gorgeous golden hue!', '2015-05-08 01:53:49.000000', NULL, 0),
