(7352982, 1148064, 113900, '<td valign="top">This is truly fantastic.  If I had one small critique, and I''m not sure its a critique so much as a curiosity on my part and that is that I think I might like it better as a square crop,  The symmetry of the posts is perfect and I think I would love to see that carried through to the crop, with the one element being asymmetrical (the bird).  Still a gorgeous shot.</td>', 'This is truly fantastic.  If I had one small critique, and I''m not sure its a critique so much as a curiosity on my part and that is that I think I might like it better as a square crop,  The symmetry of the posts is perfect and I think I would love to see that carried through to the crop, with the one element being asymmetrical (the bird).  Still a gorgeous shot.', '2015-05-25 02:43:46.000000', NULL, 0),
